Nikki: Chinese and Russian for the redesigned pages

Patches 0001 and 0002 added and reworded 254 strings on the Nikki pages (the status header,
the setup checklist, the profile list, the editor, the log viewer, the help text of every
option, subscription auto-update). luci-app-nikki ships zh_Hans, zh_Hant and ru translations,
and none of them had these strings, so those pages fell back to English half-way through.

Each of the three .po files gains the 254 entries, appended at the end with a "#: CleanWRT"
source note. Terms follow the files' existing ones (配置文件 / 設定檔 / профиль for Profile,
混入 / Mixin, 订阅 / 訂閱 / подписка). Every translation keeps exactly the placeholders of its
msgid (checked by script), and all three files compile with msgfmt --check-format and po2lmo.
The translations were written for CleanWRT, not by native speakers of each language; fixes
are welcome.

Applies to: https://github.com/nikkinikki-org/OpenWrt-nikki.git @ 0c56ba5f, after 0002.
Upstream status: local to CleanWRT.

